  "title": "Test Parachute Team Jumps in U-2 Dragon Lady Pressure Suit Beale Air & Space Expo 2025",
  "description": "U.S. Air Force Search, Evasion, Rescue, and Escape specialists from Beale Air Force Base and Edwards Air Force Base as well as one parachutist from the U.S. Army prepare for a parachute drop in a full pressure suit worn by U-2 Dragon Lady pilots, Beale Air Force Base, California, June 7, 2025. The Beale Air & Space Expo 2025 was the first time a free fall jump in these suits has been performed in public, and extensive testing was undergone to jump in this non-standard equipment. (U.S. Air Force video by Charles Borsos)",
